        style 16 fill:#3f7d3a,stroke:#2c5728,color:#ffffff
        17["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Logistics and Auto-Collect</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: JavaScript]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>When unlocked, step() drains<br />whole units from any<br />extractor within<br />AUTO_COLLECT_RANGE (3.0<br />tiles) of the player and<br />pushes a transient {res, amt,<br />x, y} event so the UI can<br />animate the flow. Walking<br />away stops collection:<br />buffers just fill and cap<br />until you return.</div>"]
